Conclusion

Path C is our pragmatic sweet spot for Windows developers. It gives us the uncompromising non-repudiation of Path B, prevents key sharing completely, and bypasses the administrative bottlenecks of traditional Active Directory mapping. It is keyless, self-service, and fully self-healing.

